# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# TooEz environment
#
#   cp .env.example .env.local     then fill in the values below.
#
# .env.local is gitignored. NEVER commit real credentials, and never put the
# key secret or webhook secret anywhere the browser can read.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ---- Razorpay TEST MODE -----------------------------------------------------
# Razorpay Dashboard → Account & Settings → API Keys → Generate Test Key.
#
# RAZORPAY_KEY_ID is Razorpay's PUBLIC identifier. It is sent to the browser on
# the customer checkout page because Razorpay Checkout requires it. That is by
# design and is safe.
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=rzp_test_your_key_id

# RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET authenticates TooEz's server-to-server API calls (create
# order, fetch payment, refund) and signs Checkout return signatures.
# SERVER ONLY. Never sent to the browser. Never logged.
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=

# RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET is a DIFFERENT secret. You choose its value when you
# create the webhook in Razorpay Dashboard → Settings → Webhooks, and paste the
# same value here. It is used only to verify the HMAC on inbound webhooks.
# It must NOT be the same value as RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET — TooEz refuses to start
# cleanly if it is.
RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

# ---- Optional: LLM narration ------------------------------------------------
# Used ONLY to phrase agent reasoning in prose. It never computes a price,
# margin, forecast or risk verdict. Leave unset for deterministic sentences.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-3-5-haiku-latest
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# ---- Optional ---------------------------------------------------------------
# TOOEZ_DB_PATH=./data/tooez.db
# TOOEZ_MERCHANT_ID=mrc_campuskitchen
# TOOEZ_MERCHANT_OWNER=Vetri          # name used in the dashboard greeting
# TOOEZ_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000  # used by the test scripts
